  A notification small icon is drawn as a monochrome mask, so it is defined as a
  solid white glyph on a transparent field: any colour here is discarded by the
  system, and a tinted icon would look wrong on some OEM skins. The shape is a
  rising line chart, standing for the equity curve.
-->
